.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-log-rules-set - Replace the log alert rules


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container log-rules set  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace the log alert rules

.PP
Sends the whole list (at most 10; empty list removes all). Keep each rule's \fBid\fR to update it in place. 409 \fBlimit_log_rules\fR, 422 with the rule number on invalid input.

.PP
API: PUT /cloud/containers/{id}/log-rules (operationId setContainerLogRules, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for set

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--rules\fP=[]
	rules

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
